  "blog_blocks": [
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-9926-7461-a38c-dbc1be4c8086",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000401",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "position": 0,
      "content": { "text": "Fresh Cuts Matter", "level": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-9a3f-72d2-8265-4dff11dcb227",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000401",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "position": 1,
      "content": {
        "text": "Trim about an inch off each stem at a 45-degree angle before placing your bouquet in water — this helps the flowers absorb water more efficiently."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-9b50-7e72-a715-644863a629b4",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000401",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "position": 2,
      "content": { "text": "Change the Water Often", "level": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-9c64-71ca-9631-db131a8da10e",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000401",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "position": 3,
      "content": {
        "text": "Replace the water every two days and keep your arrangement away from direct sunlight and heating vents to extend its life by up to a week."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-9e92-70b4-a116-e4d8dc247ffe",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000402",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "position": 0,
      "content": { "text": "Anniversaries", "level": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-9fa8-76f5-b7cb-b752771822ff",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000402",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "position": 1,
      "content": {
        "text": "Red roses remain the classic choice for romance, while a mix of red and white roses symbolizes unity and lasting love."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-a0bf-7811-8312-76e0ffe23bb0",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000402",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "position": 2,
      "content": { "text": "Birthdays", "level": 2 }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f4ce6-a1d6-7601-be62-3f552b3e03d0",
      "blog_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000402",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "position": 3,
      "content": {
        "text": "Bright, playful blooms like gerberas and sunflowers suit the celebratory mood of a birthday far better than more formal arrangements."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "019f59be-38a0-7e3e-8e41-636a988e3bb8",
